        'The PPF illustrates opportunity cost visually. Moving along the curve, producing more healthcare means less defense (and vice versa). The shape of the curve shows that opportunity costs typically increase: the more you specialize in one thing, the more expensive each additional unit becomes, because you\'re pulling resources away from where they\'re most productive.',
