      ['What percentage of Grameen Bank borrowers are women?','97% of the 9.4 million borrowers. Muhammad Yunus proved that poor women are excellent credit risks, Grameen\'s repayment rate is 97%, higher than most commercial banks.', { stat: '97% paid back', sprite: 'handshake' }]
