      'The Russia-Ukraine energy crisis perfectly illustrates why capstone thinking matters. Analyzing it through only one lens, say, supply and demand, misses the trade dependence that caused it, the monetary policy dilemma it created, the developmental havoc it wreaked, and the behavioral dynamics that amplified it.'
